; modelreload.eval - the reload after modelfiles.eval (code-review C301).
; Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 50, in a SECOND process on the same
; scratch world and WITH ITS WINDOW - drawn= is what a rendered frame's draw
; handed the weapon's part, and a headless run renders none. The world load
; builds every item kind, the weapon on its .gltf among them, and eval_arena's
; load the decoration on its .glb - each of which aborted the load before.
;
;   --- reload ---  `modelfile` for both (the weapon's set on its part; the
;                   decoration's model opened by the level, nothing else in this
;                   world naming it), the decoration standing on 5,5 (`editor
;                   inspect`), and `levelcheck` passing a world with both in it.
;                   Then the inspector and the editor shut (each replaces the
;                   scene) and the weapon laid on the floor ahead of the party.
;   --- drawn ---   the albedo the weapon's part was HANDED by the last frame's
;                   draws (DrawPart's stamp) and by the details dialog's preview,
;                   beside the set's own at this tier (`textures load`);
;   --- low ---     the same after `quality 0` (1k), and
;   --- ultra ---   after `quality 3` (4k): a part looks the set's maps up as it
;                   draws and a swap frees and reloads them, so a draw handed a
;                   map kept from before reads "stale".
;
; A `quality` applies on the frame after it, so an `echo frame` sits between
; it and the readout - as after the drop, so a frame has drawn the weapon.
; `lang en` because the judge rebuilds the inspect line from en.lang; the judge
; puts settings.ini back (quality and language both save).

logecho on
reset
lang en
editor
echo --- reload ---
modelfile weapons et_gltf_weapon
modelfile decorations et_glb_deco
editor inspect 5 5
levelcheck
editor inspect off
editor off
tp 14 12
face n
drop et_gltf_weapon 14 11
echo frame
echo --- drawn ---
modelfile weapons et_gltf_weapon
textures load cobblestone_wall
quality 0
echo frame
echo --- low ---
modelfile weapons et_gltf_weapon
textures load cobblestone_wall
quality 3
echo frame
echo --- ultra ---
modelfile weapons et_gltf_weapon
textures load cobblestone_wall
echo --- end ---
